ity tools; and Commerce Hub, a B2B commerce suite that provides payment links, invoices, quotes, subscription management, and automation and revenue reporting; and breeze, an AI that powers the customer platform that provides AI-powered insights, automation, content generation, and data enrichment, as well as Breeze Assistant, a go-to-market assistant to boost productivity and make work easier; and Breeze Agents, which helps teams automate work end-to-end from strategy to execution. In addition, the company provides professional services to educate and train customers on how to utilize its CRM platform; and customer success; phone and/or email and chat-based support services; and helps customers by providing Customer Success Manager and Partner Development Manager digital channels through educational content academey. It serves mid-market business-to-business companies. The company was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","employees":9016,"website":"https://www.hubspot.com","country":"United States","city":"Cambridge","officers":[{"name":"Ms. Yamini  Rangan","title":"CEO, President and Director"},{"name":"Mr. Dharmesh  Shah","title":"Co-Founder, CTO & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Kathryn A. Bueker","title":"CFO & Treasurer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.26,"tpe":31.4,"ps":4.764,"pfcf":26.86,"peg":1.15,"pb":4.974,"ev_ebitda":20.02,"rev_growth":0.17,"eps_growth":0.345,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2306,"eps_growth_next":0.1867,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1243,"roa":0.04866,"de":29.26,"gross_margin":0.5169,"op_margin":0.1199,"profit_margin":0.08708,"current_ratio":1.825},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":18.26,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":89.57,"sector":31.4,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.722,"sector":4.764,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":19.26,"sector":26.86,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.32,"sector":1.15,"verdict":"Und